# Casey Jones, Vigilante, cast on turn 3, draws three cards. Bot2's turn-4 upkeep is not "your next upkeep": Bot1's
# hand is untouched there. At Bot1's turn-5 upkeep three of its seven cards are discarded at random (which three is the
# game's random source, so only the counts are asserted), before the turn's draw. The delayed trigger is used up: on
# turn 7 nothing more is discarded.

